[en.CHARACTER_NIGHT_GLIDER_NAME]
Night Glider

[en.CHARACTER_NIGHT_GLIDER_DESC]
Night Glider loves flying, and she often dreams of joining the Wonderbolts and becoming a black lightning in the sky. She admires Rainbow Dash and her Sonic Rainboom, calling herself “Rainbow Dash of Our Town”.

After the formation of the Resistance, she became the commander of the Pegasi. She often takes the Pegasi to the sky to drive away the reconnaissance Pegasi that threaten production. Even when facing enemies several times her size, she never backs down, doing her best to protect the sky for the ponies.

[zh.CHARACTER_NIGHT_GLIDER_NAME]
夜翔

[zh.CHARACTER_NIGHT_GLIDER_DESC]
夜翔酷爱飞行，她常常梦想自己能加入闪电天马队，成为空中的一道黑色闪电。她十分崇拜云宝和她的彩虹引爆，把自己称作“平等镇的云宝”。

抵抗军成立后，她如愿以偿，成为了天马指挥官。她时常带着天马们飞上天空，驱逐威胁生产的侦察天马。即使面对数倍于己的敌人，她也毫不退缩，拼尽全力保护小马们的天空。
